113 #uuid "3d18142b-aa1e-57ea-9669-93dca8ee3908" 13194139534862 true] [17592186315681 1145 "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{3}^{1}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can split up the given integral using the sum rule and factor out the constants. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}(7f(x)+2)\\,\\text{d}x & =7{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+2{\\int }_{1}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =7(4)+2\\cdot x\\,{|}_{1}^{3} \\\\  & =28+2(3-1) \\\\  & =28+4 \\\\  & =32.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534862 true] [17592186315682 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315683 13194139534862 true] [17592186315682 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315684 13194139534862 true] [17592186315682 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315685 13194139534862 true] [17592186315682 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315686 13194139534862 true] [17592186315682 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315687 13194139534862 true] [17592186315682 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534862 true] [17592186315682 1041 "selection" 13194139534862 true] [17592186315682 1104 #edb/ref 17592186315685 13194139534862 true] [17592186315682 1110 #uuid "172a3372-f8ae-5e6c-a3d7-62217779873c" 13194139534862 true] [17592186315683 1034 "12" 13194139534862 true] [17592186315683 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534862 true] [17592186315683 1111 #uuid "806fdf4b-d184-51a3-b2d1-ebba9540063c" 13194139534862 true] [17592186315684 1034 "22" 13194139534862 true] [17592186315684 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534862 true] [17592186315684 1111 #uuid "7fb7424e-7dce-5bb6-bb2d-583ca746897f" 13194139534862 true] [17592186315685 1034 "32" 13194139534862 true] [17592186315685 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534862 true] [17592186315685 1111 #uuid "f46aed68-3045-5f14-963c-6577e48a9a92" 13194139534862 true] [17592186315686 1034 "30" 13194139534862 true] [17592186315686 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534862 true] [17592186315686 1111 #uuid "e4e5dc23-5514-516b-b1cb-ff25820